# `@repo/ui` Component Structure

Components live under **category folders** in `packages/ui/src/`:

| Category | Purpose | Example import |
|----------|---------|----------------|
| `cards/` | Card-style composites | `@repo/ui/cards/CallToActionCard` |
| `common/` | Brand / shared primitives | `@repo/ui/common/Logo` |
| `layout/` | Page shell & navigation | `@repo/ui/layout/AppLayout` |
| `kit/` | Interactive UI widgets | `@repo/ui/kit/AdaptiveSlider` |

Each category has an `index.ts` barrel (`@repo/ui/cards`, `@repo/ui/common`, etc.). Individual components are also reachable via `@repo/ui/<category>/<ComponentName>`.

## Per-component folder shape

Every component lives in a **PascalCase folder** with exactly four files:

```
packages/ui/src/cards/CallToActionCard/
  CallToActionCard.tsx          # component implementation
  CallToActionCard.styles.ts    # all styles via tailwind-variants (`tv`)
  CallToActionCard.types.ts     # props and related types
  index.ts                      # public exports
```

## Rules

1. **One component per folder** — folder name matches the component name.
2. **Styles only in `*.styles.ts`** — use `tailwind-variants` (`tv`) with `slots` + `variants`. Do not scatter `className` strings for layout/variants in the TSX beyond composing slot results / consumer overrides.
3. **Types only in `*.types.ts`** — props and related types live here; re-export from `index.ts`.
4. **`index.ts` is the public API** — export the component, variants helper (if useful), and types.
5. **Import path** — consumers use `@repo/ui/<category>/<ComponentName>` or the category barrel `@repo/ui/<category>`.
6. **Primitives** — build with `@heroui/react` + `@repo/icons` (see `ui-icons-heroui` rule). Brand assets like `Logo` / `LogoMark` live in `common/`.

## Example

```ts
// CallToActionCard.styles.ts
import { tv } from "tailwind-variants";

export const callToActionCardVariants = tv({
  slots: { root: "...", action: "..." },
  variants: {
    variant: {
      primary: { root: "bg-warning ..." },
      outlined: { root: "border-2 border-warning ..." },
    },
  },
  defaultVariants: { variant: "primary" },
});
```

```ts
// index.ts
export { CallToActionCard } from "./CallToActionCard";
export { callToActionCardVariants } from "./CallToActionCard.styles";
export type { CallToActionCardProps } from "./CallToActionCard.types";
```
